ES:
A ti no te conozco.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}
No eres de aquí, ¿verdad?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Este pueblo es de lo mejorcito.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Como un sueño hecho realidad.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Disfruta de la visita,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
Non ti ho mai vist{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} prima!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Sei di
un'altra città?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beh, questa città è molto charmant.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È come un sogno a occhi aperti.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Divertiti,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
Bak sen, yeni bir yüz.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Başka bir kasabadan
mı geldin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Şunu söyleyeyim, EN iyi kasaba BURASI.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Resmen rüya gibi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ziyaretinin tadını çıkar,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Vienes de visita?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
No me importaría hacerte de guía,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}pero hoy estoy falta de sueño.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Que te diviertas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sei qui in visita, eh?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Vorrei tanto farti da guida in città,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}ma devo andare a fare la zampicure.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Comunque, spero che ti divertirai,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Du bist wohl nicht von hier?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich würde dich gerne herumführen,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}aber ich bin so müde...
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Trotzdem wünsche ich dir viel
Spaß,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}And what do we have here?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
A visitor?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} visitor,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} this is {{TAG:0005:0005:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
The town of your dreams!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Please
explore to your heart's content!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bakın burada ne varmış?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir ziyaretçi mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pekâlâ,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} sevgili
ziyaretçi,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} burası {{TAG:0005:0005:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Rüyalarının kasabası!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Gönlünce gezip dolaş lütfen!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Wir kennen uns noch nicht, oder?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Angenehm. Viel Spaß beim Erkunden
von {{TAG:0005:0005:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
